cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "pg-tileserver"
abstract: "A small vector tile server in Go that turns PostGIS tables into Mapbox Vector Tiles with ST_AsMVT / ST_TileEnvelope. It discovers layers on its own, serves TileJSON, keeps an in-memory LRU cache and ships a MapLibre preview page. It is a learning project in the spirit of pg_tileserv and Martin."
authors:
